{
  "_comment": "WhatsApp Flow — mark attendance by exception. Serves BOTH actors: a teacher marking students and a principal marking teachers. Same screens, same interaction; only the subject differs, supplied by the endpoint.",
  "_instructions": [
    "1. Registered automatically by `npm run setup:flows` (flow-configs.js → 'Attendance Marking').",
    "2. The resulting Flow ID is written to ATTENDANCE_MARKING_FLOW_ID in your .env.",
    "3. Endpoint (data_api_version 3.0, encrypted): POST /api/flows/attendance-marking.",
    "4. The roster is populated dynamically by the endpoint's INIT. Modelled on the proven dynamic-list data_exchange pattern also used by exam-checker-confirm-students-flow.json."
  ],
  "_notes": [
    "MARK BY EXCEPTION. The teacher taps only who is AWAY; everyone untapped is present. A 30-student class is two taps, and the screen says so rather than leaving it to be discovered.",
    "A CheckboxGroup is required here, not an interactive list: WhatsApp caps list messages at 10 rows (whatsapp.service.js) and a real class is 30-225 students.",
    "Absent and on-leave are SEPARATE CheckboxGroups rather than a per-student picker — two taps for the common case, and it keeps 'leave' a first-class status instead of collapsing it into absent.",
    "leave_type is asked on its own screen, and ONLY when at least one person is on leave, so the common path never sees it.",
    "CONFIRM names the people being marked before the write. The previous principal channel took typed coordinates like '2,5,6L' and never named anyone back — one typo silently marked the wrong colleague absent."
  ],
  "version": "6.3",
  "data_api_version": "3.0",
  "routing_model": {
    "MARK": [
      "LEAVE_TYPE",
      "CONFIRM"
    ],
    "LEAVE_TYPE": [
      "CONFIRM"
    ],
    "CONFIRM": [
      "SAVED"
    ],
    "SAVED": []
  },
  "screens": [
    {
      "id": "MARK",
      "title": "Mark attendance",
      "data": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Grade 5 - A · Mon 10 Aug"
        },
        "subject_note": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Tap only the students who are away. Everyone else is marked present."
        },
        "roster": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "s1",
              "title": "Ahmed Raza",
              "description": "Roll 4"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2",
              "title": "Ayesha Bibi",
              "description": "Roll 7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "mark_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.subject_note}"
              },
              {
                "type": "CheckboxGroup",
                "name": "absent",
                "label": "Absent",
                "required": false,
                "data-source": "${data.roster}"
              },
              {
                "type": "CheckboxGroup",
                "name": "on_leave",
                "label": "On leave",
                "required": false,
                "data-source": "${data.roster}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Continue",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "MARK",
                    "absent": "${form.absent}",
                    "on_leave": "${form.on_leave}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "LEAVE_TYPE",
      "title": "Type of leave",
      "data": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "1 person on leave"
        },
        "names": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Hamza Ali"
        },
        "leave_types": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "casual",
              "title": "Casual"
            },
            {
              "id": "sick",
              "title": "Sick"
            },
            {
              "id": "official",
              "title": "Official duty"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "leave_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.names}"
              },
              {
                "type": "RadioButtonsGroup",
                "name": "leave_type",
                "label": "Type of leave",
                "required": true,
                "data-source": "${data.leave_types}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Continue",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "LEAVE_TYPE",
                    "leave_type": "${form.leave_type}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CONFIRM",
      "title": "Confirm",
      "data": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "25 present · 2 absent · 1 on leave"
        },
        "detail": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Absent: Ahmed Raza, Bilal Hussain\nOn leave (casual): Hamza Ali"
        },
        "overwrite_note": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": ""
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "confirm_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.detail}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextCaption",
                "text": "${data.overwrite_note}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Save attendance",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "screen": "CONFIRM",
                    "confirm": "save"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SAVED",
      "title": "Saved",
      "terminal": true,
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Saved · 25 present · 2 absent · 1 on leave"
        },
        "detail": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Thank you — that is today done."
        },
        "overwrite_note": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": ""
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "saved_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.detail}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextCaption",
                "text": "${data.overwrite_note}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Done",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "complete",
                  "payload": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
